# Local-only folders. `private/` holds notes and source material that stay
# on this computer. `temp/` holds one folder of revisions per page and is
# tracked, so it syncs between computers (the repo is public: nothing private
# goes in it). Third-party chart images in `world-data-chart/source-images/`
# are copyrighted and stay local.

private/
temp/about-me/world-data-chart/source-images/*.png

